  - m_Id: 510273461936128
    m_Localized: My tools
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936129
    m_Localized: Wayfinder scroll
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936130
    m_Localized: Undo spool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936131
    m_Localized: Return hourglass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936132
    m_Localized: Hints one move per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936133
    m_Localized: Extra undo on this board after 2 free ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936134
    m_Localized: Restores last broken board once per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936135
    m_Localized: Pick up to two tools per stage. Each works once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936136
    m_Localized: Wear it on the map. Earn it in parcels too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936137
    m_Localized: 'Bag: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936138
    m_Localized: Already yours
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936139
    m_Localized: Yours forever. No gameplay advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936140
    m_Localized: "Checking the route\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936141
    m_Localized: Use one
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936142
    m_Localized: 'Buy: {0} coins'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936143
    m_Localized: Need {0} more coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936144
    m_Localized: Bag is full
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936145
    m_Localized: Added to your bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936146
    m_Localized: Coins kept. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936147
    m_Localized: Open a level first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936148
    m_Localized: Your bag is empty
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936149
    m_Localized: Already used this stage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936150
    m_Localized: Use your free undos first
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936151
    m_Localized: No move on this board to undo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936152
    m_Localized: No broken board to return to
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936153
    m_Localized: Scroll kept. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936154
    m_Localized: Item kept. Try elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936155
    m_Localized: Back on the board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936156
    m_Localized: One move undone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936157
    m_Localized: Follow the hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936158
    m_Localized: 'Undo: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936159
    m_Localized: Two free undos per stage. Only on the current board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 510273461936160
    m_Localized: Retry is free. A return hourglass can bring the last board back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 511543182614528
    m_Localized: The row is ready. Keep your scroll.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 513635720880128
    m_Localized: Tool bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 513635725074432
    m_Localized: No ads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517884924125184
    m_Localized: Once per stage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517884928319488
    m_Localized: Yours forever
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816343937024
    m_Localized: Put its pictured piece above the bomb. Stop it before the count
      reaches zero.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131328
    m_Localized: Put its pictured piece above the key. The branch opens and you can
      swap there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131329
    m_Localized: Put its pictured piece above the toolbox. It repairs this board
      once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131330
    m_Localized: Match the spool picture. You earn one swap past one or two pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131331
    m_Localized: Match the stamp picture, then finish the level to keep your bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131332
    m_Localized: Match the hourglass picture. The bomb waits two swaps. The wood
      still wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131333
    m_Localized: You can swap across this bridge once. Then that path closes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131334
    m_Localized: These pairs are tied together. Swap one pair and the other swaps
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131335
    m_Localized: A swap at the cracked spot uses twice as much wood. Try another
      path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131336
    m_Localized: The branch blocks this swap. Use another pair or go down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131337
    m_Localized: The rollers move every piece one place on landing. The end piece
      goes to the other end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131338
    m_Localized: On the mirror board, the row turns around. The last piece becomes
      the first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131339
    m_Localized: Wind moves the whole row one place on landing. Look at the arrow
      before going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131340
    m_Localized: A gust rocks the boards and pieces. They settle back into place.
      Your order stays safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131341
    m_Localized: Follow the hand for one move. Up to 2 tools per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131342
    m_Localized: One extra Undo on this board, after 2 free Undos.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131343
    m_Localized: Restore this stage's last broken board. Later moves undone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131344
    m_Localized: Closed path
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131345
    m_Localized: A gust of wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131346
    m_Localized: Got it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 527816348131347
    m_Localized: Use it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 542516121165824
