  - m_Id: 797900375318567
    m_Localized: 'Lights for a parcel: {0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318568
    m_Localized: A little surprise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318569
    m_Localized: 20 coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318570
    m_Localized: +20 coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318571
    m_Localized: New look for Mika!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318572
    m_Localized: A reward for your journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318573
    m_Localized: Yours to keep
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318574
    m_Localized: Explorer hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318575
    m_Localized: Frog suit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318576
    m_Localized: Star knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318577
    m_Localized: Fox mask
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318578
    m_Localized: Drifting leaves
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318579
    m_Localized: Soft raindrops
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318580
    m_Localized: Twinkling stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318581
    m_Localized: Floating petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318582
    m_Localized: Test video
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318583
    m_Localized: Could not save. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318584
    m_Localized: Choose a look
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318585
    m_Localized: I signed every bridge I built. Now my name is on a pile of broken
      boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318586
    m_Localized: Walter. Builder, bread lover. I test the boards before I butter
      the bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318587
    m_Localized: We'll mend this crossing first. Then I can see where the light needs
      to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318588
    m_Localized: He's lined up three buckets. We'd better fill one before he finds
      a fourth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318589
    m_Localized: He copied my spinning trick. I need to show him how to stop, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318590
    m_Localized: I planted this tree when I was small. I saved its seeds before the
      fruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318591
    m_Localized: I'll plant one by Grandma Ada's window. She can watch for the first
      leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318592
    m_Localized: I argued with an old friend. I've carried an apology in my pocket
      for months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318593
    m_Localized: What do you want her to hear? You can tell me before you write it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318594
    m_Localized: That I was wrong. Somehow I keep writing about the weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318595
    m_Localized: I'd want to read that, even if the rest of the page stayed empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318596
    m_Localized: Then we won't take it. I'll trace the road onto a spare page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318597
    m_Localized: My teacher drew every bend. Leave me the original; I'll check your
      copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318598
    m_Localized: You check the turns. I'll mark a dry place for us to stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318599
    m_Localized: The first marker is under that drift. I'll clear it if you hold
      the lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318600
    m_Localized: One bearing was wrong. I shut the chart and kept checking it alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318601
    m_Localized: Show me the mark you trust. I'll check it from the other side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318602
    m_Localized: The first crossing
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318603
    m_Localized: I'll mark the first missing board. Tell me when you're ready to
      cross.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318604
    m_Localized: Ready to help, yes. Ready to look down... not yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318605
    m_Localized: One gear, one bucket
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318606
    m_Localized: I'll fit this gear. My brother can hold the bucket where it's dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318607
    m_Localized: I'll check the pipe. A turning wheel won't help if the bucket stays
      empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318608
    m_Localized: A pocket of seeds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318609
    m_Localized: Take three seeds. The rest stay here, for the orchard after us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318610
    m_Localized: Three seeds, one letter. I'll ask Grandma Ada for a pot when we
      get home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318611
    m_Localized: The first honest sentence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318612
    m_Localized: I'll write the apology. Please keep the other letters out of that
      puddle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318613
    m_Localized: I'll gather them. Leave your letter on top, where you can see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318614
    m_Localized: The nearest lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318615
    m_Localized: That first lamp is beside the pier. We can reach it from dry boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318616
    m_Localized: Show me that one. I'll think about the farther shore when we get
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318617
    m_Localized: A map for the road
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318618
    m_Localized: Hold that corner. This copy needs the shelter, not every mountain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318619
    m_Localized: And room for anything we find. I'll bring those notes back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318620
    m_Localized: Half a scarf each
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318621
    m_Localized: I led Ben through this fog once. Today I could use a paw to follow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318622
    m_Localized: Here. Keep half the scarf, and stop me if I start hurrying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318623
    m_Localized: The keeper's lamp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318624
    m_Localized: Take my lamp. I'll hold the rail; you watch the wick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318625
    m_Localized: Your lamp and mine. I'll keep them low until the lift is steady.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318626
    m_Localized: A second reading
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318627
    m_Localized: The moon dial should point there. I haven't had a second reading
      in months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318628
    m_Localized: You read the scale. I'll hold the light, then we can swap places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318629
    m_Localized: Walter. I built these bridges. The boards survived better than my
      confidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318630
    m_Localized: Clara. Stay on the pier with me. We can start from dry boards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318631
    m_Localized: Oscar. No wet paws on the maps. Wet paws may use the towel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318632
    m_Localized: Felix. I've checked this chart six times. It still needs another
      observer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318633
    m_Localized: I crossed the whole bridge. First time since the storm. The bread
      got here warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318634
    m_Localized: Your brother put his bucket down. He can use both paws to wave now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318635
    m_Localized: My three seeds are still dry. One day their fruit will light this
      road too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318636
    m_Localized: My letter went with the basket. I wrote the apology, not the weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318637
    m_Localized: You sent it. Now she gets to choose her first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318638
    m_Localized: The water gate is open. Mother's boat can follow its old lamps again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318639
    m_Localized: I stayed for the whole launch. Next time I'll help with the sail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318640
    m_Localized: The copy has every turn. I added the shelter my teacher forgot to
      mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318641
    m_Localized: I'll add a mark when we stop there. You'll know we found it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318642
    m_Localized: The shelter is warm. I kept saying I was fine; my paws say otherwise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318643
    m_Localized: Sit with me. I'll mark this stop on Oscar's map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318644
    m_Localized: The sky lantern is up. I held the rail this time, and you held the
      light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318645
    m_Localized: I nearly turned back at Walter's bridge. I'm glad I told him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318646
    m_Localized: I marked the gap instead of hiding it. The gliders can use the route
      we checked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318647
    m_Localized: Nora can carry the corrected chart. She'll want a copy for the post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318648
    m_Localized: This bridge leads to Ben. I left my lunch on this side every day
      since the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318649
    m_Localized: One gear first. Last time I spun the wheel before my brother moved
      his bucket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318650
    m_Localized: The seed house is cold. I planted my first tree from a tray just
      like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318651
    m_Localized: The mail basket is heavy. My apology is on top; I promised not to
      hide it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318652
    m_Localized: I'll hold the basket. You can check the address one last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318653
    m_Localized: Each lamp marks a turn. Mother taught me the route; I still count
      them aloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318654
    m_Localized: This is my teacher's last map. I won't risk it under an open sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318655
    m_Localized: Then let me trace the route. Your map can stay dry here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318656
    m_Localized: I built this shelter after guiding Ben home. I'd forgotten how low
      its door is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318657
    m_Localized: The lantern lift jammed in the storm. I kept its parts in my soup
      pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318658
    m_Localized: Let's put them back. Then you can use the pot for supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318659
    m_Localized: The wind took one corner of this chart. I stopped sharing the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318660
    m_Localized: I can hear the water. Once the pipe is clear, my brother can put
      his bucket down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318661
    m_Localized: He can carry his tea cup instead. Walter saved him a slice of bread.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318662
    m_Localized: Mother called this boat Leaf. I called every boat Leaf for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318663
    m_Localized: Then this one is Little Leaf. It deserves a lamp of its own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318664
    m_Localized: There are biscuit crumbs in this map. My teacher used it as a tray.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318665
    m_Localized: Then a little rain won't be its strangest journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318666
    m_Localized: That gust lifts the snow sideways. Even the path needs a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318667
    m_Localized: I'll wait with you. The beacon won't run away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318668
    m_Localized: You've tucked Rose's seeds beside the wick. Mind they don't get
      toasted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318669
    m_Localized: They're for your window. First we'll find them a pot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318670
    m_Localized: I left blank spaces on the chart. Blank isn't the same as wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318671
    m_Localized: I'll draw the clouds lightly. We can rub them out tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318672
    m_Localized: I checked that joint again. No creak. I might walk over for lunch
      tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318673
    m_Localized: I'll wait on the far side. With bread, if the baker has any left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318674
    m_Localized: 'I wrote: I was wrong to leave without listening. Now the page can
      dry.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318675
    m_Localized: I'll keep the bag open for it. No hiding it underneath this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318676
    m_Localized: The original is back on its shelf. Your copy already has a new shelter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318677
    m_Localized: I'll pencil in each place we stop. The next traveller can use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318678
    m_Localized: I burnt the soup twice watching that bridge. You can stir while
      I watch the wick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318679
    m_Localized: Gladly. And I've brought enough stories to last until it's ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318680
    m_Localized: I put two pencils by the chart. Someone sharpened the spare while
      we worked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318681
    m_Localized: Leave the second stool there. They may want to finish their drawing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318682
    m_Localized: I kept the boards dry. The next crossing still needs a lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318683
    m_Localized: I'll carry it. You can show me where the sound boards go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318684
    m_Localized: My brother's bucket reminds me who I'm keeping this wheel turning
      for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318685
    m_Localized: Good. Let's check where the water will come out first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318686
    m_Localized: Mind that low nest. The birds use this path too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318687
    m_Localized: I'll keep the light below it. Have you found a dry place for the
      seeds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318688
    m_Localized: Sky post! One bag for deliveries, one pocket for my apology.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318689
    m_Localized: I'll carry the bag. You keep that pocket where you can reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318690
    m_Localized: The nearest lamp is still our first stop. I can hold the boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318691
    m_Localized: I'll bring the light along the pier. Tell me when the boat is ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318692
    m_Localized: One travelling copy. One dry original. I have counted them twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318693
    m_Localized: I'll bring back the copy with our stops marked. Keep a pencil for
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318694
    m_Localized: The wind has covered another marker. Stay within reach of my scarf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318695
    m_Localized: Only if you stay within reach of mine. We can stop whenever you
      need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318696
    m_Localized: The lamp is ready. My knees would like the handrail checked first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318697
    m_Localized: I'll check them. Then we can carry the light side by side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318698
    m_Localized: I left the chart open this time. There is a pencil for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318699
    m_Localized: I'll mark what I can see. You can check it against the dial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318700
    m_Localized: There may be news for Grandma Ada in those letters. Let's bring
      them down safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318701
    m_Localized: I'll hold the lamp. Tell me if the snow has swallowed the next step,
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420247281664
    m_Localized: Atmosphere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447488
    m_Localized: Frames
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447489
    m_Localized: Use this style
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447490
    m_Localized: Remove style
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447491
    m_Localized: Buy with coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447492
    m_Localized: Coins only
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447493
    m_Localized: Petal waltz
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447494
    m_Localized: Dusk lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447495
    m_Localized: Wing garden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447496
    m_Localized: Spring flight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447497
    m_Localized: Dragonfly mirror
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447498
    m_Localized: Sky lanterns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447499
    m_Localized: Quiet snowfall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420272447500
    m_Localized: Star trails
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641792
    m_Localized: Garden carving
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641793
    m_Localized: Cloud edging
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641794
    m_Localized: Copper filigree
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641795
    m_Localized: Moon silver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641796
    m_Localized: Petals and garden visitors
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641797
    m_Localized: Soft firefly lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641798
    m_Localized: Butterflies and drifting pollen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641799
    m_Localized: Birds in the distance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641800
    m_Localized: Dragonflies over the islands
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641801
    m_Localized: Slow floating lanterns
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641802
    m_Localized: Snowflakes and winter birds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641803
    m_Localized: Falling stars and moon moths
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641804
    m_Localized: Leaves around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641805
    m_Localized: Feathers around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420276641806
    m_Localized: Copper around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 948420280836096
    m_Localized: Moonlight around the game screen
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 952944215187456
    m_Localized: Scene
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572045967360
    m_Localized: That joint is holding. I still hear the storm in every creak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161664
    m_Localized: I hear it too. Will you try the next board with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161665
    m_Localized: The hinge is quieter. My knees are jealous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161666
    m_Localized: Your knees can take a break. I'll stay beside the gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161667
    m_Localized: The lift rises a little now. I wish my stomach would stay in the
      workshop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161668
    m_Localized: Mine wants to stay too. Shall we test it without passengers first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161669
    m_Localized: One lamp is back. The baker says worrying burns more bread than
      her oven.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161670
    m_Localized: Then we'll give her something else to watch. A second lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161671
    m_Localized: I packed two lunches. Habit. I wasn't sure I'd dare bring even one
      across.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161672
    m_Localized: Keep mine warm, Walter. I'm not crossing without you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161673
    m_Localized: It caught once! I nearly cheered right into the gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161674
    m_Localized: I heard it too. Your brother will want to hear the whole turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161675
    m_Localized: There's a trickle here. I used to stop checking as soon as the wheel
      moved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161676
    m_Localized: Let's walk to your brother's bucket. Water needs to get there, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161677
    m_Localized: My brother wants the first turn. I keep reaching for his bucket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161678
    m_Localized: Let him try the rope when it's ready. You can stand beside him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161679
    m_Localized: We can finish one seam at a time. She'll see you kept at it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161680
    m_Localized: Rose asked for one cup. I brought three. I always overfill apologies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161681
    m_Localized: Bring the cups. I'll tell her you remembered the seeds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161682
    m_Localized: One branch glows. That robin is checking every nest before it trusts
      us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161683
    m_Localized: It can take its time. So can we.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161684
    m_Localized: That root is older than my bridge. I won't cut it to save a few
      steps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161685
    m_Localized: Then the road can bend. Roots can't pick another way home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161686
    m_Localized: The path is clearing. I kept the jars here so long I nearly ate
      winter's share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161687
    m_Localized: Let's save Grandma Ada one. She'd want to hear the story before
      tasting it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161688
    m_Localized: A little warmth at last. My first tree began smaller than your button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161689
    m_Localized: I'll keep its three seeds near me. Grandma Ada has a sunny window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161690
    m_Localized: Nora's scarf caught on that branch once. She called it an unscheduled
      delivery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161691
    m_Localized: When she visits again, you can tell her the branch still remembers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161692
    m_Localized: I found a letter to a new baby. I've been late for their very first
      hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161693
    m_Localized: They'll still get the hello. We'll keep looking for the others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161694
    m_Localized: Your gran's envelope has worn corners. You've held it through every
      gust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161695
    m_Localized: One landing board is steady. I used to think flying made me independent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161696
    m_Localized: A place to land helps. So does someone keeping it ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161697
    m_Localized: My letter is still on top. I keep finding reasons to check the stamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161698
    m_Localized: The stamp won't answer you, Nora. Your friend might.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161699
    m_Localized: I can see Clara's shore. I used to wave from above and count that
      as a visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161700
    m_Localized: When the gate opens, stay awhile. I'll carry your bag.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161701
    m_Localized: These boards hold. Mother taught me to leave room for a frightened
      passenger.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161702
    m_Localized: Leave room for me, then. I'm still frightened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161703
    m_Localized: Two lamps so far. I still hear Mother naming each turn when I count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161704
    m_Localized: Say them aloud. I'd like to learn her road from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161705
    m_Localized: The gate has shifted. Little Leaf keeps tapping, as if I'm late
      for supper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161706
    m_Localized: We'll get her home. Will you hold the boat when I step aboard?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161707
    m_Localized: The pond light flickered. Mother always cupped her paws round it
      like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161708
    m_Localized: I can hold it that way. Show me once more before we leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161709
    m_Localized: The archive path is clearer. Oscar may ask what you'll give back
      for his map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161710
    m_Localized: Dry paws first. Then I'll ask what he needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161711
    m_Localized: The door moves a little. I'd counted every page before I checked
      the hinge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161712
    m_Localized: Then let's give the hinge a little of that attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161713
    m_Localized: One shelf is free. I keep reaching for a knot that isn't there anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161714
    m_Localized: Your books are staying put. You can let your paws rest too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161715
    m_Localized: The first turns are copied. My teacher used to leave room for other
      paws' notes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161716
    m_Localized: I'll leave that room too. I won't know every turn on the road.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161717
    m_Localized: The ink is holding. I nearly thanked your scarf before I thanked
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161718
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada would accept thanks for the scarf. I'll take a dry page.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161719
    m_Localized: I can reach one corner of Grandma Ada's note. I've kept it away
      from damp for so long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161720
    m_Localized: A little longer, then. I'd rather hear her words than hurry and
      blur them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161721
    m_Localized: Three lamps found. I said I knew the road, then the snow covered
      my proof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161722
    m_Localized: You knew where to look. Let me clear enough to see with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161723
    m_Localized: The shelter is less draughty. I'm sorry I kept telling you my paws
      were warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161724
    m_Localized: Mine weren't either. We can say so sooner next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161725
    m_Localized: Near side checked. I dislike a crossing I can't see the end of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161726
    m_Localized: Then we wait for a clear view. I can be brave after a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161727
    m_Localized: Ben folded this blanket badly. That crooked corner has kept my paw
      warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161728
    m_Localized: It fits two travellers anyway. Ben thought further ahead than he
      knew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161729
    m_Localized: That window keeps appearing between gusts. I know the road; I can't
      quiet the sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161730
    m_Localized: I'll wait with you. Grandma Ada kept her lamp on; I can keep mine
      on too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161731
    m_Localized: You mend that joint like Walter. I still remember your paws barely
      reaching mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161732
    m_Localized: They shook on his bridge, Grandma Ada. He stayed until I could take
      a step.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161733
    m_Localized: One pulley turns. I suppose my soup pot will eventually get its
      proper job back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161734
    m_Localized: Ben would ask to check the far end first. I'll do that, then stir.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161735
    m_Localized: The first steps are bright. I kept thinking I ought to carry you
      as I used to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161736
    m_Localized: Let me carry the light this time. You can lean on me if you need
      to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161737
    m_Localized: The lantern is rising a little. You brought it all this way without
      letting go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161738
    m_Localized: Not by myself. Clara held the boat, and Alice held on to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161739
    m_Localized: The lens catches a small glow. I still check the window, even with
      you beside me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161740
    m_Localized: Someone else may be looking for home. Let's keep a light for them
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161741
    m_Localized: Two ticks agree. I used to trust a number more than a second pair
      of eyes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161742
    m_Localized: You can trust both. Mine get tired too; we'll take turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161743
    m_Localized: A board still needs fixing. I drew its missing edge instead of stepping
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161744
    m_Localized: Your drawing helped us find it. Now I'll hold the lantern while
      you look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161745
    m_Localized: I've joined these pieces. There's still a gap where I once guessed
      a bearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161746
    m_Localized: Mark the gap. Nora needs to know where to look as much as where
      to fly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161747
    m_Localized: I like the view beside you. Leave a little room for my tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161748
    m_Localized: The gate stirs. I keep rehearsing what to say when a traveller arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161749
    m_Localized: Start with 'come and sit'. That's how my best roads began.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161750
    m_Localized: Half the hull is patched. I promised Nora a boat, not a floating
      sieve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161751
    m_Localized: I chose words all night. In the end, I just wrote that I missed
      her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 978572050161752
    m_Localized: One pattern shines. I used to tell myself company would spoil the
      quiet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271629819904
    m_Localized: Mushroom hat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014208
    m_Localized: Bee costume
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014209
    m_Localized: Winter hood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014210
    m_Localized: Sky pirate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014211
    m_Localized: Cloud jester
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014212
    m_Localized: Star mage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014213
    m_Localized: Leaves in the breeze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014214
    m_Localized: Warm pollen lights
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014215
    m_Localized: Soft snowfall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014216
    m_Localized: Feathers in the sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014217
    m_Localized: Dancing petals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014218
    m_Localized: Twinkling stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014219
    m_Localized: Ribbon carnival
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014220
    m_Localized: Letters to wind
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014221
    m_Localized: Cloud dreams
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014222
    m_Localized: Aurora curtain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014223
    m_Localized: Trailing ribbons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014224
    m_Localized: Paper wings in flight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014225
    m_Localized: Pearl bubbles rise
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 988271634014226
    m_Localized: Waves of northern light
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382117916672
    m_Localized: I marked the boards that held. Tomorrow I want to cross without
      counting them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110976
    m_Localized: Keep the marks. Courage can have a little help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110977
    m_Localized: I made this gate for Ben. He used to race its shadow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110978
    m_Localized: Then let's leave him something familiar when he comes back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382122110979
    m_Localized: My first lift carried nothing but a potato. Father insisted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305280
    m_Localized: A very brave potato. We can start that small too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305281
    m_Localized: The market went quiet after the storm. I miss being asked to fix
      things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305282
    m_Localized: I'll tell them who brought the lamps back. Bring your toolbox tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305283
    m_Localized: Tell Ben I checked every bolt. No, tell him I'm coming myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305284
    m_Localized: He'll like the second message better. So do I.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305285
    m_Localized: Walter says a wheel needs listening, not cheering. I can do both
      quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305286
    m_Localized: I'll listen on this side. Tell me when you hear the knock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305287
    m_Localized: I promised everyone water before breakfast. That was three breakfasts
      ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305288
    m_Localized: Tell them where we've reached. They can wait better when they know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305289
    m_Localized: He tied that knot himself. I nearly fixed it before looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305290
    m_Localized: It holds. Maybe ask him to show us the next one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305291
    m_Localized: Nora painted a little bird here. I thought it was just a stain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305292
    m_Localized: Let's mend around it. She should recognise her boat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305293
    m_Localized: I forgot the orchard needed water too. I only saw our empty well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305294
    m_Localized: Now you've noticed. We can carry the first cups together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305295
    m_Localized: Those nests were here before my lanterns. I'm a guest too, really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305296
    m_Localized: Then we'll make a quiet light. Enough to find home, not wake everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305297
    m_Localized: Walter offered a straight bridge. I asked him to walk the old path
      first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305298
    m_Localized: Did he see the nests? I'll show him the ones near the bend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305299
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada always returned her jars with a note inside. I kept
      every one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305300
    m_Localized: Would you put a note in hers this time? I'll deliver it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305301
    m_Localized: Seeds don't promise they'll grow. I plant them anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305302
    m_Localized: I'll ask Grandma Ada for a pot. We can send you news of the first
      leaf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305303
    m_Localized: Nora hasn't stopped here since she lost the mail. She thinks I'm
      angry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305304
    m_Localized: I'll tell her there's still a place at your table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305305
    m_Localized: I know every address, but I hardly know who waits behind the doors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305306
    m_Localized: This time we can knock and stay for an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305307
    m_Localized: I thought a good letter had to sound clever. Yours sounds like you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305308
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada will know who wrote it before she sees my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305309
    m_Localized: Walter left extra nails. He said landing is part of flying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305310
    m_Localized: He knows more about the sky than he thinks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305311
    m_Localized: If Clara doesn't answer, will you still walk with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305312
    m_Localized: Yes. But we should give her time to read it first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305313
    m_Localized: I'm taking the slow boat this time. No waving from the clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305314
    m_Localized: Then she can wave back and know you've seen her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305315
    m_Localized: I kept Mother's boat tied up. It felt safer than making new memories
      in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305316
    m_Localized: We don't have to go far. The first trip can end right here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305317
    m_Localized: This one is Heron Bend. She named it after a bird that stole our
      lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305318
    m_Localized: I'll remember that one. And keep our lunch under the seat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305319
    m_Localized: Nora wrote that she's coming by boat. She never used to have the
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305320
    m_Localized: Maybe leave a second cushion ready. You needn't decide what to say
      yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305321
    m_Localized: I thought I'd forget her voice if someone else learned her little
      rituals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305322
    m_Localized: When I do this, I'll remember who taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305323
    m_Localized: Tell Oscar his towel is still in my boat. I washed it twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305324
    m_Localized: I'll return it with your message. A dry introduction should help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305325
    m_Localized: People stopped visiting when I made too many rules about the books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305326
    m_Localized: Keep the towel. Perhaps lose the rule about whispering outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305327
    m_Localized: I tied every shelf after the storm. Then I couldn't reach my favourite
      book.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305328
    m_Localized: Which one is it? We'll leave it somewhere you can reach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305329
    m_Localized: 'This margin says: a fox found a shorter path. My teacher trusted
      strangers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305330
    m_Localized: Someone had to let the fox borrow the map first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305331
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada spilled tea on this page years ago. I kept the stain
      in every copy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305332
    m_Localized: She'll laugh when I tell her. She always blamed the cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305333
    m_Localized: She asked me to share the route, not guard it. I read that rather
      late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305334
    m_Localized: We're here now. May I take a copy for the next traveller?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305335
    m_Localized: I used to follow my own tracks home. Today yours are beside them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305336
    m_Localized: Two sets should be easier to find when we turn back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305337
    m_Localized: I thought a guide wasn't allowed to need a blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305338
    m_Localized: I'd rather follow a warm guide. Here, take this end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305339
    m_Localized: The old bridge rang in winter. I miss knowing where I was by its
      sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305340
    m_Localized: When it's safe again, let's stop and listen before crossing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305341
    m_Localized: I owe Ben a letter. I never thanked him for sending this ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305342
    m_Localized: Nora can carry it. She's learning to stop for replies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305343
    m_Localized: I can take you to her door. Will you come back and tell me how she
      is?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305344
    m_Localized: Come in with me. Grandma Ada always puts out another cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305345
    m_Localized: I rehearsed a brave welcome. All I wanted was to hear your paws
      outside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305346
    m_Localized: You don't have to be brave for me, Grandma Ada. I'm here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305347
    m_Localized: I repaired that lift alone for years. Asking Walter felt like admitting
      my age.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305348
    m_Localized: He misses being needed. You'd be giving him something too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305349
    m_Localized: Your little paw used to fit on this stair. You insisted on climbing
      yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305350
    m_Localized: I still do. But now I know I can hold your paw too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305351
    m_Localized: I kept the lantern bright so no one would guess I was tired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305352
    m_Localized: Let me take a turn. You can sit where you can see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305353
    m_Localized: Beyond our beacon, Felix keeps watch alone. I should have visited
      sooner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305354
    m_Localized: We'll take him tea. This time the light comes with company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305355
    m_Localized: I thought the sky had changed. Perhaps I forgot how to ask for another
      view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305356
    m_Localized: I'll stand here. Tell me what you see, and I'll tell you mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305357
    m_Localized: This telescope belonged to my sister. She was never afraid to turn
      it elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305358
    m_Localized: What did she like looking for? We can try her favourite corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305359
    m_Localized: Oscar left blank space on this chart. I nearly filled it before
      looking up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305360
    m_Localized: Let's leave room for something neither of us has noticed yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305361
    m_Localized: That little cluster looks like a teapot to me. The book calls it
      a crown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305362
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada would choose the teapot. Can a sky have both names?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305363
    m_Localized: I'll leave the door unlatched tonight. Someone may want to see what
      we found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1027382126305364
    m_Localized: And tomorrow I'll bring our friends. Save a little sky for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029391699968
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894272
    m_Localized: Look closer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894273
    m_Localized: Unavailable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894274
    m_Localized: Choose a tool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894275
    m_Localized: Choose a level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894276
    m_Localized: Without help
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894277
    m_Localized: Visits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894278
    m_Localized: Next parcel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894279
    m_Localized: Saved on this phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894280
    m_Localized: Available on your phone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894281
    m_Localized: Try another way
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894282
    m_Localized: Retry is free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894283
    m_Localized: Shows one safe move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894284
    m_Localized: One extra undo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894285
    m_Localized: Restores the last board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894286
    m_Localized: Safe move; costs wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894287
    m_Localized: Shows the next landing before you drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894288
    m_Localized: Watch, then follow the hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894289
    m_Localized: 2 tools per stage. Up to 2 stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894290
    m_Localized: Test only. No payment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894291
    m_Localized: Removes ad breaks. Reward videos stay optional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894292
    m_Localized: Ad breaks are off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1090029395894293
    m_Localized: 'New puzzles: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1096096339189760
    m_Localized: Ready!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1189116615057408
    m_Localized: Stars
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1225130616283136
    m_Localized: Stage {0}/3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241003825553408
    m_Localized: Drag onto a neighbour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1241003829747712
    m_Localized: Tap one, then its neighbour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322146058240
    m_Localized: Next level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252544
    m_Localized: +{0} moves before breaking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252545
    m_Localized: 'Stamp: +100 points'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252546
    m_Localized: Drag one piece onto another, or tap both. Every exchange wears down
      the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252547
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the toolbox. It adds the shown number
      of moves before the board breaks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252548
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the key. The locked link opens for
      exchanges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252549
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the bomb before its counter runs out.
      A blast removes board durability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252550
    m_Localized: Collect the ribbon with the pictured piece. Then exchange two pieces
      up to three places apart once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252551
    m_Localized: Collect the frost flask. The bomb waits for two exchanges, but the
      board still wears down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252552
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the stamp for 100 bonus points. The
      receiver still needs the exact row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252553
    m_Localized: 'This link works once. Plan the row before crossing it: it closes
      after the exchange.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252554
    m_Localized: Exchange one marked pair and both marked pairs move together. One
      move changes four positions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252555
    m_Localized: An exchange across a cracked link costs two durability instead of
      one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252556
    m_Localized: Pieces cannot cross a closed link. Go down to a board with the links
      you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252557
    m_Localized: When the row lands on this board, its order reverses. Prepare the
      row before going down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252558
    m_Localized: On landing, every piece moves one place in the arrow direction.
      The end piece wraps around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252559
    m_Localized: After the shown number of exchanges, wind shifts the whole row one
      place. Plan for the shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252560
    m_Localized: Undo returns the pieces and board to before your last move. You
      have two free returns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252561
    m_Localized: Go down early to use the next board. The row stays with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252562
    m_Localized: The lantern shows one useful move. Follow it on the real row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1266322150252563
    m_Localized: Watch what changes, then try it on your row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1268672927621120
    m_Localized: +{0} durability
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1268672936009728
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the toolbox. It restores the shown
      durability for more exchanges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948832231424
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425728
    m_Localized: Decline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425729
    m_Localized: Continue mission
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425730
    m_Localized: Personal mission, stage {0}/3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425731
    m_Localized: Thank you! The delivery helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425732
    m_Localized: Mend the boards and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425733
    m_Localized: Open the route with the key and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425734
    m_Localized: Deal with the bombs and deliver the row safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425735
    m_Localized: Use the ribbon to reach across the row and deliver it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425736
    m_Localized: Collect the stamps and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425737
    m_Localized: Cross the one-use bridges and bring the row home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425738
    m_Localized: Move the linked pairs into order and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425739
    m_Localized: Plan around the fragile boards and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425740
    m_Localized: Prepare for the changing row and bring it home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425741
    m_Localized: Find a route through the closed paths and deliver the row.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425742
    m_Localized: Put my scattered supplies in order and bring them home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425743
    m_Localized: The bridge needs supplies. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425744
    m_Localized: The garden needs water from my mill. {0} Three tricky stages. Will
      you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425745
    m_Localized: My lantern grove needs a delivery. {0} Three tricky stages. Will
      you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425746
    m_Localized: The wind scattered the sky post. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425747
    m_Localized: The harbour is waiting for supplies. {0} Three tricky stages. Will
      you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425748
    m_Localized: The library needs these parcels. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425749
    m_Localized: The snow road needs warm lights. {0} Three tricky stages. Will you
      help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425750
    m_Localized: The beacon needs a special delivery. {0} Three tricky stages. Will
      you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1296948836425751
    m_Localized: The observatory needs new lenses. {0} Three tricky stages. Will
      you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1402326270074880
    m_Localized: Saved here. Older level results need verification before cloud transfer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1417343845523456
    m_Localized: Purchases are temporarily unavailable. Contact support.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013172908032
    m_Localized: Sign in with Apple or Google
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102336
    m_Localized: Manage account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102337
    m_Localized: Keep this phone's save
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1556013177102338
    m_Localized: Apple or Google protects your progress and verified purchases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1570345583632384
    m_Localized: '{0} move'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489219325952
    m_Localized: Privacy Policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297472
    m_Localized: Terms of Use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297473
    m_Localized: Support
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297474
    m_Localized: Open on website
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297475
    m_Localized: Full documents are in English
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1590489240297476
    m_Localized: Purchase restoration needs the store connection. No coins are spent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1619703867891712
    m_Localized: Free hint used
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984198168576
    m_Localized: If the beacon goes dark, stay off the upper bridges. I'll keep my
      window lamp lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362880
    m_Localized: That was Grandma Ada's last message. The beacon is dark now. I need
      to reach her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362881
    m_Localized: The cargo lifts still work. Each landing takes its supplies in a
      marked order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362882
    m_Localized: So I sort the load on the way down. You use what arrives to repair
      our crossing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362883
    m_Localized: Yes. The receiver won't take a mixed-up load. These worn boards
      won't wait forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362884
    m_Localized: Then show me the order at the bottom. I'll get the first load to
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362885
    m_Localized: I'm Mika. Grandma Ada is at the dark beacon. I need a safe way to
      reach her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362886
    m_Localized: The loaded boat stays dry. Nora can collect mail from the village
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362887
    m_Localized: Then I'll take my letter to her at the sky post.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362888
    m_Localized: I'll help gather them. Then I have a letter of my own to send to
      Grandma Ada.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362889
    m_Localized: Mine is still in my pocket. Now we can send it with the recovered
      mail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362890
    m_Localized: Your letter has left for the beacon. The next keeper will carry
      it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362891
    m_Localized: Clara's pier is beyond the lagoon gate. I sent the apology; now
      I need to listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362892
    m_Localized: I'll go with you. She can tell us if she wants company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362893
    m_Localized: The pier is safe. Tell Nora she may come ashore. We have things
      to talk about.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362894
    m_Localized: I'll tell her. And I'll stay by the lamp while you talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362895
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada's note marks the sheltered approach to the beacon. Alice
      knows that ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362896
    m_Localized: Let's find Alice. We'll take your copy and bring back the missing
      turns.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362897
    m_Localized: The copy marks the known turns and the gap. Alice will check that
      part on the ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362898
    m_Localized: The beacon road is clear. Grandma Ada answered your signal; she
      knows we're coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362899
    m_Localized: She saw us! Let's keep the lamp raised until we reach the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362900
    m_Localized: Walter's bridge, Ben's mill... they're answering. Our way home is
      their road, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362901
    m_Localized: Now we can check the part of the route the tower was hiding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362902
    m_Localized: A delivery cart broke the footbridge rail. I need parts before it
      returns. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362903
    m_Localized: My brother's new well has a leaking valve. Help me get a replacement
      to him. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362904
    m_Localized: A nest is stranded beyond the orchard path. I need a lamp for its
      tree. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362905
    m_Localized: A mail basket missed its landing. Help me recover it before the
      envelopes get wet. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362906
    m_Localized: A boat is waiting at the unlit pier. Will you bring a lamp down
      to it? {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362907
    m_Localized: The roof needs another patch. Help me deliver the tiles before the
      next rain. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362908
    m_Localized: Travellers used the shelter's last fuel. Let's refill it before
      nightfall. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362909
    m_Localized: The spare wick has arrived below the beacon. Will you bring it up
      with me? {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362910
    m_Localized: A cracked lens hides the eastern route. Help me deliver a new one
      intact. {0} Three harder stages.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362911
    m_Localized: The far anchor pulled loose, not the boards. My first repair missed
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362912
    m_Localized: Then we secure that end before anyone crosses. I'll hold the load
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362913
    m_Localized: The gate opens, but the latch won't hold. One gust could slam it
      shut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362914
    m_Localized: Let's test the latch before we send the lift through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362915
    m_Localized: The empty lift runs. I haven't trusted it with a passenger since
      the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362916
    m_Localized: Send the tools first. If they arrive safely, I'll take the next
      trip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362917
    m_Localized: The baker won't open after dark. She can't see the gap by her door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362918
    m_Localized: The next lamp goes there, then. Bread can wait; a safe doorway can't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362919
    m_Localized: Ben asked for my tools. I've packed them every morning, then stayed
      home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362920
    m_Localized: Bring them with us today. You can tell him yourself what needs fixing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362921
    m_Localized: The wheel turns, but that knock means a tooth is still out of place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362922
    m_Localized: Stop it while we fit the last pieces. Faster won't make them fit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362923
    m_Localized: Water reaches this joint, then leaks away. The village still gets
      nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362924
    m_Localized: I'll follow the pipe to the last house. We finish when their tap
      runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362925
    m_Localized: My brother can lower the bucket. The handle slips when he pulls
      it back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362926
    m_Localized: Let's fix the handle for his paws, not yours. Then let him test
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362927
    m_Localized: The boat floats empty. With the mail aboard, water comes through
      this seam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362928
    m_Localized: Keep the letters ashore. We'll test it with the toolboxes first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362929
    m_Localized: Rose sent seeds when our mill failed. I still haven't taken her
      any water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362930
    m_Localized: Fill a can. Once this crossing is ready, we'll carry it to her together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362931
    m_Localized: That nest has chicks. Their parents won't leave while the branches
      are dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362932
    m_Localized: We'll light their tree first. The harvest can wait until they can
      feed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362933
    m_Localized: The broken support rests on a living root. Pull it out and both
      may fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362934
    m_Localized: We'll brace the bridge, then free the root. We don't have to cut
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362935
    m_Localized: These jars were promised to the mill. I've been rationing them here
      instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362936
    m_Localized: Once the cart can pass, send the promised crate first. I'll help
      load it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362937
    m_Localized: The seed trays are dry, but the night air gets in beneath the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362938
    m_Localized: Let's seal the gap. I want these seeds to survive more than this
      one storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362939
    m_Localized: Nora used this path every week. The unopened mail is still on my
      table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362940
    m_Localized: Keep it for her. We'll reopen the path so she can collect it herself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362941
    m_Localized: Two envelopes lost their addresses. I can't just choose a house
      for them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362942
    m_Localized: Bring them to the post desk. Someone may recognise the handwriting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362943
    m_Localized: Your letter can leave with the next bag. Are you sure it's finished?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362944
    m_Localized: I added everyone's names. Grandma Ada should know who is helping
      me reach her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362945
    m_Localized: I can fly over the gap. The full mail cart can't. I forgot who uses
      this bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362946
    m_Localized: Then test it with the cart. We'll leave a route everyone can use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362947
    m_Localized: I keep checking the stamp on my apology. It's easier than sending
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362948
    m_Localized: Put it in the basket yourself. I'll stay until it leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362949
    m_Localized: Clara is the friend I wrote to. I don't know if she'll want to see
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362950
    m_Localized: We can ask. Opening the path doesn't mean she owes us an answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362951
    m_Localized: Nora's letter arrived. I haven't answered. We still need this pier
      repaired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362952
    m_Localized: We'll repair it. You can decide about the letter when you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362953
    m_Localized: From shore, those lamps look alike. From a boat, one marks a dangerous
      turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362954
    m_Localized: Show me from the boat, then. Hold it steady while I step in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362955
    m_Localized: The gate catches the smallest sail. Mother always lowered it before
      passing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362956
    m_Localized: We'll leave enough room for the sail. The next sailor may not know
      that trick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362957
    m_Localized: This lamp was Mother's. I'd rather it lit your road than stayed
      on my shelf.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362958
    m_Localized: I'll bring it back. And I'll tell you where its light took us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362959
    m_Localized: Tell Nora there's a place at my table. I still want to hear her
      say it aloud.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362960
    m_Localized: I'll tell her before we leave for the archive. This message shouldn't
      wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362961
    m_Localized: The door swelled in the rain. Forcing it will tear the map caught
      underneath.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362962
    m_Localized: Lift this corner with me. We can free the paper before opening the
      door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362963
    m_Localized: I tied the shelves together during the storm. Now I can't reach
      the roof ladder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362964
    m_Localized: Brace one before moving the other. Your books can stay where they
      are.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362965
    m_Localized: My teacher left this turn blank. I've been afraid to admit the map
      is incomplete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362966
    m_Localized: Mark the gap on my copy. Alice can check it; a guess could send
      us off the ridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362967
    m_Localized: The leak is above the map cabinet. Saving one page won't keep the
      rest dry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362968
    m_Localized: I'll move the cabinet. You mend the roof before we uncover the maps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362969
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada left this note before the storm. It tells us how to
      approach the beacon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362970
    m_Localized: Then it's directions, not news. We'll still need to find out if
      she's safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362971
    m_Localized: Your map leaves this fork blank. The old path ends at a fallen ledge
      now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362972
    m_Localized: Let's mark the safe fork for Oscar. Nobody should follow the old
      line blindly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362973
    m_Localized: I said we could reach the beacon tonight. I can't feel my paws now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362974
    m_Localized: Then we stop here. I'll light the shelter; you take Ben's blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362975
    m_Localized: The near edge is sound. I can't see where the far one lands through
      this snow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362976
    m_Localized: Let's secure the far landing before we cross. I can wait for a clear
      view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362977
    m_Localized: Ben packed two blankets. I thought he'd miscounted. One is for the
      next traveller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362978
    m_Localized: We'll leave it in the shelter, wrapped dry. He thought further ahead
      than us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362979
    m_Localized: 'That window flashed twice. That''s a keeper''s signal: someone
      is there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362980
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada taught me the reply. Hold my lantern high enough for
      her to see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362981
    m_Localized: I saw your reply from the window. I nearly came out onto the broken
      bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362982
    m_Localized: Stay by the rail. I'll come to you as soon as this side holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362983
    m_Localized: The lift jammed with the lens aboard. I couldn't bring it down alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362984
    m_Localized: We won't pull against the jam. I'll unload it in the order you show
      me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362985
    m_Localized: I left the upper lamps dark to save oil. I was waiting for you to
      come home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984202362986
    m_Localized: I'm here now. Let's light the stairs for both of us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557184
    m_Localized: Two small flames won't make the beacon brighter unless the lens
      is aligned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557185
    m_Localized: You watch the beam. I'll adjust the frame until it reaches Walter's
      island.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557186
    m_Localized: A light answered from the mill. They're waiting to see if we'll
      stay lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557187
    m_Localized: Then I'll learn to tend it, too. You shouldn't have to keep watch
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557188
    m_Localized: The dial agrees with the beacon. My chart was using the old starting
      mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557189
    m_Localized: Let's correct that before checking the stars. The same error could
      shift every route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557190
    m_Localized: I watched from the doorway after the bridge broke. It hid half the
      sky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557191
    m_Localized: We'll reach the telescope. No wonder you couldn't check those bearings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557192
    m_Localized: This torn corner holds the turn after the ridge. Without it, a pilot
      must guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557193
    m_Localized: We'll mark that route closed until it's checked. The others can
      still open.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557194
    m_Localized: That glider follows the first lamps, then circles back. Our next
      turn is still dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557195
    m_Localized: Light the turn before signalling him through. He needs a route,
      not a promise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557196
    m_Localized: Nora checked our route from the air. She found a lamp hidden behind
      the tower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557197
    m_Localized: We'll move it, then ask her to fly once more. This time we check
      together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557198
    m_Localized: Your letter arrived before you did. I kept it beside the window
      lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557199
    m_Localized: Then you know their names. I want you to meet them when the road
      is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557200
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada's old route note is in that cabinet. We need to stop
      the leak to reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557201
    m_Localized: The islands are familiar, but here every piece is a shape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557202
    m_Localized: Another version of our sky. The crossings here still need their
      own repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557203
    m_Localized: Then I'll bring what I learned across, not pretend the work here
      is already done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557204
    m_Localized: The same islands... but letters are hanging where the shapes used
      to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557205
    m_Localized: A parallel sky. Here the cargo forms words, and each crossing has
      its own answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557206
    m_Localized: I remember you. Let's see what this version of our journey has to
      say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557207
    m_Localized: Shapes beside letters! It's as if our two skies have met.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557208
    m_Localized: A third path, with both kinds of cargo. A familiar face won't make
      its puzzles familiar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557209
    m_Localized: Good. We'll try a new answer instead of following our old footprints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557210
    m_Localized: Back to shapes. I recognise this bend in the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557211
    m_Localized: I kept your place. The other sky can wait while we finish our crossing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557212
    m_Localized: We're back among the letters. I remember where we stopped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557213
    m_Localized: Then we can leave the introductions behind and pick up our unfinished
      words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557214
    m_Localized: Letters and shapes together again. This is the path we left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1626984206557215
    m_Localized: Your lantern still marks where we stopped. I'll walk with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1807274946322432
    m_Localized: Finish signing in in your browser, or cancel here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1807274950516736
    m_Localized: Sign-in timed out. Your save is safe. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1807274950516737
    m_Localized: Sign-in failed. Your save is safe. Try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1807274950516738
    m_Localized: Cancel sign-in
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1827980845244416
    m_Localized: Pruning saw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1827980849438720
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the saw. It cuts the branch so you
      can exchange across that gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1827980849438721
    m_Localized: Put the pictured piece above the saw. It cuts the branch and opens
      that exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1828625455243264
    m_Localized: Branch {0} cleared
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801105182720
    m_Localized: 'Using any tool: max 2 stars. {0}/2 uses left this stage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377024
    m_Localized: Two tools already used this stage. More uses unlock next stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377025
    m_Localized: The bulb shows one move; you make it. The counter is for this stage.
      When empty, an optional video adds one hint.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377026
    m_Localized: The scroll guides you through this board. Follow the hand; it never
      moves pieces for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377027
    m_Localized: "The lens previews the row after the next drop, including the next
      board\u2019s effect. It does not move your pieces."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377028
    m_Localized: The lantern makes one safe move for you. One item is consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377029
    m_Localized: After both free undos, use a spool to undo one more move on this
      board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377030
    m_Localized: Return to the board you just left, with its row and durability restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377031
    m_Localized: Tap the bag to open or fold the tray. Tap an available tool to use
      one. At most two tools per stage; using one caps this level at two stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377032
    m_Localized: Use this tool
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377033
    m_Localized: Back to game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377034
    m_Localized: Next lesson
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377035
    m_Localized: Watch a video to reveal one move. You still make the move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377036
    m_Localized: Watch video +1 hint
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377037
    m_Localized: Extra hint ready. Tap the bulb.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377038
    m_Localized: Video unavailable. Use a free hint if one remains, or try Undo or
      a tool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377039
    m_Localized: Only from parcels. Cannot be bought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377040
    m_Localized: Only from parcels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377041
    m_Localized: One safe move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377042
    m_Localized: Paper crane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377043
    m_Localized: Little comet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377044
    m_Localized: Dew bell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377045
    m_Localized: Night flower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377046
    m_Localized: Cloud kite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377047
    m_Localized: Fern compass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377048
    m_Localized: Amber moth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377049
    m_Localized: Moon boat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377050
    m_Localized: Exclusive crane brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377051
    m_Localized: Exclusive comet brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377052
    m_Localized: Exclusive dew bell brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377053
    m_Localized: Exclusive flower brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377054
    m_Localized: Exclusive kite brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377055
    m_Localized: Exclusive compass brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377056
    m_Localized: Exclusive amber moth brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1838801109377057
    m_Localized: Exclusive moon boat brooch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1839700787585024
    m_Localized: No tool uses left this stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1842113615486976
    m_Localized: 'Uses left this stage: {0}/2. Each type once.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1842113619681280
    m_Localized: Using a tool limits this level to 2 stars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975395504128
    m_Localized: Repair kit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698432
    m_Localized: Adds 2 durability to this board. Bomb timers keep running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698433
    m_Localized: The kit adds two durability to this board. It does not stop bombs
      or wind. One kit is consumed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698434
    m_Localized: This board is strong enough. Keep your kit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698435
    m_Localized: 'Board reinforced: +2 durability'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698436
    m_Localized: Each type once; 2 tools per stage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698437
    m_Localized: Changes appearance only. Stays yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1850975399698438
    m_Localized: You need {0} more coins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1853488769261568
    m_Localized: 2 tools per stage. Each type once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1853488773455872
    m_Localized: 'Using tools: max 2 stars for the level.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1854488812969984
    m_Localized: Board durability +2. Bombs and wind keep running.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1861032799625216
    m_Localized: "My things \u2192 Trophies\nTurn this look on or off there."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1861032803819520
    m_Localized: View in bag
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864420333445120
    m_Localized: Circular saw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864420333445121
    m_Localized: Claim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1864420333445122
    m_Localized: Watch ad +40 coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081750913024
    m_Localized: Stuck? Undo and try a different move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081780273152
    m_Localized: Go lower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081855770624
    m_Localized: Watch a video for 1 extra hint this stage. You still make the move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081855770625
    m_Localized: No hints left this stage. Video unavailable; try Undo or a tool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081855770626
    m_Localized: No path. Undo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2191081855770627
    m_Localized: No path. Retry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565773144064
    m_Localized: Keep your journey
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338368
    m_Localized: Sign in to save progress and purchases across devices.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338369
    m_Localized: Continue with Apple
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338370
    m_Localized: Continue with Google
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338371
    m_Localized: Continue without an account
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338372
    m_Localized: You can choose a provider in the secure sign-in window.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2205565777338373
    m_Localized: Your progress is saved on this phone. Sign-in activates when the
      Apple and Google configuration is added.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2209378231902208
    m_Localized: Claim trophy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307738161152
    m_Localized: If you see my window light, I'm still here. Don't try the broken
      bridges alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132672
    m_Localized: She wrote that before the storm. The beacon is dark, but I can't
      see her window from home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132673
    m_Localized: I built that bridge. Twenty winters it stood. Now I can't even put
      my name on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132674
    m_Localized: Don't scrape it off yet. How will I know whom to thank when I get
      across?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132675
    m_Localized: You think an old builder can mend this? I've spent three days sorting
      nails.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132676
    m_Localized: Then you know where every nail is. That's a start. I'll hold the
      lantern for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132677
    m_Localized: All right. Pass me the long ones. And tell your gran her bridge
      builder hasn't retired.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132678
    m_Localized: Tell her yourself when the road is open. She always sets one extra
      cup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132679
    m_Localized: Hear that? No mill wheel. I used to complain it woke me before breakfast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132680
    m_Localized: There are buckets at every door. Even the little houses have big
      ones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132681
    m_Localized: My brother asked if rain could fill them. I said I'd have the mill
      running by lunch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132682
    m_Localized: Which lunch? Today's or yesterday's?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132683
    m_Localized: Yesterday's. I turned the wheel too fast and snapped another tooth.
      He saw everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132684
    m_Localized: Then let him see you fix it too. My gran says hiding a broken cup
      never mends it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132685
    m_Localized: I'll ask him to bring the spare gear. And I'll tell him why we need
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132686
    m_Localized: I'll wait by his bucket. This time let's promise water, not a lunchtime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132687
    m_Localized: Rose sent us fruit through the storm. I haven't taken her water
      in weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132688
    m_Localized: Bring a watering can. A thank-you might be thirsty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132689
    m_Localized: Mind that crooked tree. I planted it the year I learnt to tie my
      apron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132690
    m_Localized: It's taller than your house now. Did you plant it crooked on purpose?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132691
    m_Localized: No. I nearly pulled it out. Now the birds nest in the bend I wanted
      to straighten.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132692
    m_Localized: Then let's leave their bend alone. Grandma Ada has room for a crooked
      tree too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132693
    m_Localized: Take these three seeds. Plant one by her window, and keep two in
      case the first sleeps in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132694
    m_Localized: I'll write to you when it wakes up. Even if it grows sideways.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132695
    m_Localized: Nora can find a house from one bent chimney. But the storm has mixed
      up all her letters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132696
    m_Localized: Perhaps there's a reply from Grandma Ada. I'll help look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132697
    m_Localized: That's mine. Please leave it. It hasn't got a stamp yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132698
    m_Localized: It's worn thin at the folds. Have you been waiting for a stamp for
      long?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132699
    m_Localized: Months. Clara asked me to stay when her mother was ill. I said I
      had deliveries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132700
    m_Localized: Is that what you wrote in the letter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132701
    m_Localized: No. Three pages about the weather. Not one word about leaving her
      alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132702
    m_Localized: Start with that word. I'll find you a stamp while you write.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132703
    m_Localized: Clara lives across the lagoon. Will you take this? I've finally
      written the first sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132704
    m_Localized: Come and give it to her. I'll walk beside you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132705
    m_Localized: I saw the post bag on the pier. Is Nora waiting outside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132706
    m_Localized: Yes. She wants to talk. I can wait here if you'd rather be alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132707
    m_Localized: After we mend the pier. Mother built it so visitors could step ashore
      with dry paws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132708
    m_Localized: I'm glad she thought of that. Mine shake when I look at deep water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132709
    m_Localized: Keep them on this board. I'll hold the boat. You needn't prove anything
      to the pond.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132710
    m_Localized: Good. I was afraid it might ask me to swim.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132711
    m_Localized: Oscar has the snow-road map. Tell him you'll bring it back. He'll
      ask twice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307759132712
    m_Localized: I'll answer twice. I need that road to reach Grandma Ada.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326976
    m_Localized: My teacher drew this map. It's the last one. If it gets wet, I can't
      ask him for another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326977
    m_Localized: Then leave it here. May I copy the road onto the back of my letter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326978
    m_Localized: There's a blank turn by the ridge. I always meant to ask him about
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326979
    m_Localized: Let's leave it blank on mine too. Alice can show us when we get
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326980
    m_Localized: Bring back what you find. He left room for notes. I thought I wasn't
      allowed to add any.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326981
    m_Localized: He left you a pencil too, didn't he? Keep it sharp for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326982
    m_Localized: Alice knows the ridge. Follow her, but don't make her hurry. She
      never asks for a rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326983
    m_Localized: I'll keep the blanket where I can reach it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326984
    m_Localized: The old turn has fallen away. Your map is wrong here. I've led travellers
      along it for years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326985
    m_Localized: Then I'm glad we have you, not just the map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326986
    m_Localized: We'll go around. I said we'd reach the beacon tonight. I shouldn't
      have said tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326987
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada would rather open her door tomorrow than have us freeze
      outside it today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326988
    m_Localized: There's a shelter below. Just until the gust passes. And perhaps
      a little longer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326989
    m_Localized: Long enough for tea. I'll pour it while you unfold Ben's blanket.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326990
    m_Localized: Two flashes in the window. Someone saw our light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326991
    m_Localized: That's her signal! Grandma Ada, don't come onto the bridge. We're
      nearly there!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326992
    m_Localized: Your scarf has a new patch. And my letter has more folds than a
      concertina.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326993
    m_Localized: I kept opening it. I knew the words, but I wanted to hear your voice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326994
    m_Localized: Here I am. Come closer. You can put that bag down for a minute.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326995
    m_Localized: Carefully! There are seeds in it. Rose sent you a tree that hasn't
      happened yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326996
    m_Localized: We'll find it a pot. Then help me with the beacon. My knees won't
      carry the lamp up anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326997
    m_Localized: I'll carry it. You tell me where to shine. Everyone down there is
      waiting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326998
    m_Localized: The mill answered our beacon. But those gliders keep turning back
      above the clouds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763326999
    m_Localized: Felix's route lamps are dark. Take him breakfast. He forgets to
      eat when he worries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327000
    m_Localized: That glider followed my chart into a cloud bank. I closed the route
      before anyone else tried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327001
    m_Localized: Did the pilot get home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327002
    m_Localized: Yes. He came back to show me the wrong turn. I was too ashamed to
      open the door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327003
    m_Localized: Could we ask him again? We could have breakfast at the telescope
      while we wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327004
    m_Localized: I'll send a signal. But we'll check the route from his glider, not
      just from my desk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327005
    m_Localized: And leave the door open. He's bringing the bit of sky we couldn't
      see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327006
    m_Localized: You left your name on it! I'll tell Grandma Ada her bridge builder
      is coming for tea.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327007
    m_Localized: Your brother heard it first. He's run off with his bucket. Let's
      see if the water reaches him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327008
    m_Localized: He filled it without asking you. Look at him trying not to spill
      a drop!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327009
    m_Localized: That chick has stopped calling. Its mother found the crooked branch
      after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327010
    m_Localized: I'll take her the waiting letters. Yours can go on top, so she sees
      your handwriting first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327011
    m_Localized: I'll draw them for Grandma Ada. The real lamp and the one that won't
      sit still in the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327012
    m_Localized: I'll bring you a drawing of the beacon. Perhaps the fish would like
      a taller lamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327013
    m_Localized: Keep a place for Nora at supper. I'll take the snow road after you
      two have talked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327014
    m_Localized: Did your teacher write in its margins too? You could show me while
      my scarf dries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327015
    m_Localized: Then let's stop halfway. You can tell me which stair squeaks, like
      you used to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307763327016
    m_Localized: I used to whistle on these bridges. Today I can't remember a single
      tune.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521280
    m_Localized: Grandma Ada whistles when her soup boils over. I know that one.
      Shall I start?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521281
    m_Localized: I tried tying this branch straight. The tree broke every ribbon
      I used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521282
    m_Localized: Perhaps it wants a bow instead. That's what I ask for when Grandma
      Ada brushes my fur.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521283
    m_Localized: Walter left a triangle mark on the crate. That must be the timber
      he promised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521284
    m_Localized: He sends the straightest boards away and keeps the crooked ones
      for his own door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521285
    m_Localized: Let's save him one straight board. Grandma Ada says his door only
      opens in dry weather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521286
    m_Localized: There's a letter on each parcel. This one spells HOME. Is it for
      the beacon?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521287
    m_Localized: For a family at the mill. They've been sleeping in the storehouse
      since the storm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521288
    m_Localized: Then their parcel goes first. I'll put Grandma Ada's letter somewhere
      dry while we carry it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521289
    m_Localized: A crate with a square, and a parcel with a letter. Who packed this
      lot?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521290
    m_Localized: The whole village. Someone even tied a biscuit to the handle. For
      the journey, they said.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521291
    m_Localized: I'll deliver everything. Except perhaps the biscuit. It might not
      survive the journey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521292
    m_Localized: There's Walter's triangle again. We left this crate by the bridge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521293
    m_Localized: And it's still dry. I covered it when the rain came. Shall we carry
      on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521294
    m_Localized: The lettered parcels! We left the last one here. Did anyone collect
      it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521295
    m_Localized: Not yet. They asked me to thank you. I'll tell them when the next
      load arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521296
    m_Localized: Our mixed delivery is still waiting. I hope nobody ate the biscuit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521297
    m_Localized: I put it in the tin. The crumbs were tempting the birds. Here, take
      it before they return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318702
    m_Localized: "Good morning"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318703
    m_Localized: "Good evening"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318704
    m_Localized: "Good morning! Mika left a lantern glowing for your next little adventure."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318705
    m_Localized: "Good morning! May your day begin softly and surprise you in a lovely way."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318706
    m_Localized: "Good morning! A fresh path is waiting whenever you have a quiet moment."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318707
    m_Localized: "Good evening! Let the day rest; Mika will keep your place on the map."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318708
    m_Localized: "Good evening! A quiet little puzzle is here whenever you feel like unwinding."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318709
    m_Localized: "Good evening! Wishing you a peaceful night and a lighter tomorrow."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 797900375318710
    m_Localized: "You’ve lit {0} paths so far. Mika saved a little light for the next."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2323307767521298
    m_Localized: No trophies yet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
